          "urpx:name": "DA-CRS-eligible customer",
          "urpx:description": "Customer is enrolled in Direct Access service. The cost-responsibility surcharge under this Schedule recovers stranded power-procurement costs allocated to customers who have departed Bundled Service. Eligibility is by enrollment record; PCIA value depends on the customer's vintage year (year of departing-load enrollment) — see per-Price ApplicabilityRule gates below.",
          "urpx:hasConditionExpression": {
            "@type": "urpx:ConditionExpression",
            "@id": "sce:da-crs-2026-03-20-cx-eligible",
